                <pb facs="1035" n="899" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg899"/>

                <head>No. 642.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Thompson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-07-11"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 11,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reimer</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Consul, Santiago, Cuba:</hi></p>
                <p>Ask courteous transmission following to Thompson, Hayti: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Impracticable this season unless particulars of actual urgency
                            furnished.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Bayard</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
